        "original_id": "aa0e4d46-2c55-5ead-a240-1ede8aaa4ca1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Beldon Katleman\n- Places: Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada, United States\n- Products: Frontier Hotel, Silver Slipper, New Frontier Hotel and Casino, Last Frontier, The Frontier\n\nFacts:\n- The New Frontier Hotel and Casino, formerly known as Last Frontier and The Frontier, was a hotel and casino on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada, United States.\n- The New Frontier Hotel and Casino was the second resort to open on the Las Vegas Strip, opening on October 30, 1942.\n- Beldon Katleman was an investor in two other casinos, the Frontier Hotel and the Silver Slipper.\n- The New Frontier Hotel and Casino operated continuously until it closed on July 16, 2007.",
